    # Requires the following emotes to be unlocked: [Awoo, [HighFive, [Yes and [Whistle 
    # Requires 'EnableOverheadMessages' set to '1'
    # Will use Emotes when Aspect, Codex or Chain Links are leveled up and when entering the Auto Heal loop
    # Also uses Emotes when certain finishers are performed (W.I.P.) and when target is eliminated
    # Cooldown defaults to 2 minutes but can be reduced via customizations in-game (375k gold reduces it to 30 seconds)
    # Add optional cooldown in UO client:  'Emote Cooldown'  (case sensitive) 
            
    if not timerexists "EmoteCooldownTimer"
        createtimer "EmoteCooldownTimer"
        settimer "EmoteCooldownTimer" SetEmoteCooldown
    endif

